## Who we are

Acme Studio is a small team of designers and developers. We build websites that are **fast**, **accessible** and easy to maintain.

## What we believe

- Content should live in plain files, under version control.
- The fewer moving parts, the fewer things break.
- Good defaults beat clever configuration.

> "Simplicity is a prerequisite for reliability." — Edsger W. Dijkstra

Want to work together? Head over to the [contact page](/contact).
